                                                                <h2 class="dark-gray-words text-large-adventure title-font medium-affirmation bottom-three">A Conversation That Starts With You</h2>
                                                                <p class="relaxed-rhythm text-normal">
                                                                        Every appointment begins with your preferences and the questions you bring with you. Rather than assuming that one approach suits everyone, Velvet Rose Studio aims to make room for a clear conversation about what you are looking for and what options may be appropriate. You can share any relevant preferences before decisions are made, ask for clarification and take time to consider the information. This thoughtful beginning
                                                                        helps set expectations and supports a more personal salon experience.
                                                                </p>
