                                                                <h2 class="dark-gray-words text-large-adventure title-font medium-affirmation bottom-three">A Welcoming, Considerate Setting</h2>
                                                                <p class="relaxed-rhythm text-normal">
                                                                        Feeling comfortable can make a meaningful difference to a beauty appointment. Velvet Rose Studio aims to offer a welcoming and considerate atmosphere where visitors can settle in, explain what matters to them and ask questions without feeling rushed. We recognise that people have different expectations and comfort levels, so attentive communication is an important part of the experience. If there is anything you would like
                                                                        the studio to know before arranging a visit, you are welcome to get in touch.
                                                                </p>
