                                                                <h2 class="dark-gray-words text-large-adventure title-font medium-affirmation bottom-three">Clear Information Before You Decide</h2>
                                                                <p class="relaxed-rhythm text-normal">
                                                                        It is easier to choose what feels right when information is explained in a straightforward way. Velvet Rose Studio encourages visitors to ask about appointment options, share their preferences and clarify anything they are unsure about before making a decision. The aim is to support a conversation that is honest and helpful, without making promises about results or assuming what you need. For the most current details,
                                                                        contact the studio directly and discuss your questions before arranging an appointment.
