                                                        <h2 class="text-fifteen-size bold-identity tight-tether dark-gray-words small-text-eighteen-size">What Shapes the Experience</h2>
                                                        <p class="top-six-position text-large-adventure eight-space-lead dense-gray-phrase">At Velvet Rose Studio, the experience is shaped by the details that matter in a personal beauty appointment: a warm welcome, time to explain your preferences and clear communication. These are guiding principles, not numerical performance claims, and each visitor’s experience may differ.</p>
                                                        <p class="top-six-position text-large-adventure eight-space-lead dense-gray-phrase">
                                                                We do not use invented client totals or unsupported performance figures to describe the salon. Instead, these points reflect the values behind the experience we aim to offer: listening carefully, explaining options clearly, respecting individual preferences and making space for questions. Contact the studio for current information about appointments and what may be suitable for you.
                                                        </p>
