                                                <p class="top-six-position text-normal seven-space-lead dense-gray-phrase">Planning a beauty salon appointment can bring up practical questions, especially if you are considering Velvet Rose Studio for the first time. The answers below offer general guidance about getting in touch and discussing your preferences. Appointment details and availability can change, so please contact the studio directly for current information before making plans.</p>
